      "message": "When `gr-main-header` is hidden on initial render, its `ResizeObserver` reports a `blockSize` of `0`, which overwrites `--main-header-height` on `document.documentElement.style` from the initial `48px` in `app-theme.ts` to `0px`. While `themeLoading` is true, `var(--main-header-height, 48px)` will evaluate to `0px` instead of reserving the 48px header space. Consider skipping the `--main-header-height` update in `gr-main-header.ts` when `this.hidden` (or `height \u003d\u003d\u003d 0`), or using a fixed fallback height here.",
